error: `receiveFrom` holds the thread until it is done, and an async function does not hold its thread
  `receiveFrom` waits for the network
  the tasks of async functions share a few threads: one that holds its thread keeps the others from running
  --> error_udp_blocking_in_async.sg:4:26
 4 |     var got = try socket.receiveFrom(ref buffer)
   |                          ^^^^^^^^^^^
  hint: `await socket.receiveFromAsync(ref buffer)` does the same work without holding the thread
